      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Enumeration Pen Testing",
      "questDescription": "Dana Osei needs the evidence synthesized without turning adjacent findings into invented attack hops. Separate the verified Unix session from supporting disclosures and untested configurations.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> The verified activity is a svc_bridgeworks session on the historian from 198.51.100.77. The account state, service disclosures, and IKE configuration remain related findings, not a proven multi-hop route.",
